    "body": "Maintainer decisions, 2026-11-25.\n\n1. \"At one point all 40+ motion types should move to the new kernel\"\n2. \"The kernel should be its own crate.\"\n\nEffects:\n- The end goal of #4023 is that each operation type plans through the path kernel.\n- The first replacement stays 2D milling and 3D Pocket, on a side branch with one switch. The other families follow later.\n- The kernel is a crate of its own. This replaces the `path_kernel` folder in `camcraft-motion` (code layout of the design record).\n- The design record (#4024, PR #4030) must name the crate, its dependencies and its users. A new dependency between our crates needs a decision entry (AGENTS.md).\n- The record must show that the stages can take the later families. It must name what does not fit.\n",
